&lt;li&gt;Fetch Discount Perks Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering - earn up to 8 hours per calendar year at nonprofit organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Referral Incentive&lt;/li&gt;
